      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA CONVICT (4) broke a string of placings finishing in the money three on end before a last start sixth (26.48) at Bulli. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and two minor placings from three starts. Has winning claims on his best figures. PURE MOMENTUM (1) ran below best last time finishing fourth (29.99) over 520m at Wentworth Park from Box 7. Hard to knock his form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. Has ability and can atone. BABY FACE BANDIT (3) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 15 length 6th at Wentworth Park (30.31). Can measure up this time. TAW GALAXY (7) hit the frame latest (29.65) when third at Wentworth Park in a NG. Has already won three times from this draw.",
